        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[O nosso fluxo de trabalho com Git]]></title>
            <link>https://exemplo.github.io/biblioconsole/blog/fluxo-git</link>
            <guid>https://exemplo.github.io/biblioconsole/blog/fluxo-git</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Adotámos ramos feature/ a partir de develop, com pull requests* revistos por um colega.]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Adotámos ramos <code>feature/*</code> a partir de <code>develop</code>, com <em>pull requests</em> revistos por um colega.</p>
<!-- -->
<div class="language-bash codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color:#393A34;--prism-background-color:#f6f8fa"><div class="codeBlockContent_QJqH"><pre tabindex="0" class="prism-code language-bash codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar" style="color:#393A34;background-color:#f6f8fa"><code class="codeBlockLines_e6Vv"><div class="token-line" style="color:#393A34"><span class="token function" style="color:#d73a49">git</span><span class="token plain"> checkout </span><span class="token parameter variable" style="color:#36acaa">-b</span><span class="token plain"> feature/US01-adicionar-livro develop</span><br></div></code></pre></div></div>
<p>Cada ramo corresponde a uma user story e cada commit segue a convenção <code>tipo(US##): descrição</code>.</p>]]></content:encoded>
            <category>Git</category>
        </item>
